day_1:
 system & GPU audit, isolated .venv creation, PyTorch with CUDA 12.4 installation, core dependencies installation (ultralytics, sahi, supervision, opencv-python-headless, streamlit, pandas, pyyaml), CUDA verification, project state update, comprehensive dataset analysis (resolution audit, 9-class frequency profiling, bounding box scale analysis, SAHI feasibility verification, configs/dataset.yaml & configs/pipeline_config.yaml setup, and sample ground-truth visualization generation), and test-split rebalancing (transferred 4 verified pure image-label pairs from train to test, resolving 0-instance gaps for Damaged Fastener and Rail Misalignment).

